  "created": "2019-10-02T02:29:40.397Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It's frustrating around a VRChat update to find people to join, since a lot of people will be running the old version for a while. This is also a problem on betas, though this is of course a much lower priority. Having the client version reported in the social status APIs so that friends running incompatible clients can be filtered would be a nice improvement for these times.",
